[00:15.26]The heavens tell the glory of Jehovah.
[00:26.40]The work of his own hand,
[00:33.66]we see in skies above.
[00:40.83]And each new day brings to him rightful praise.
[00:51.56]The starlit night proclaims his might,
[00:59.00]His wisdom, and his love.
[01:13.36]Jehovah’s law is perfect, life-restoring,
[01:23.12]And his reminders guide
[01:26.77]the steps of old and young.
[01:33.64]His rulings prove to be true, right, and just.
[01:44.10]His word is sure, his law so pure,
[01:50.26]So sweet upon the tongue.
[01:59.74]The fear of God is pure and lasts forever.
[02:10.10]The worth of his commands
[02:13.86]exceeds the finest gold.
[02:21.01]His orders lead and preserve all his own.
[02:31.02]His honor, fame, and holy name,
[02:41.40]We loyally uphold.
